{"voice":"IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD","model":"eleven_v3","chunks":[{"audio":"/audio-chapters/1.4-1.mp3","steps":[{"key":"intro","text":"Chapter 1.4: Problem and Solution Fit. Let's read it together, and I'll explain each part as we go.","words":[[0.268,0.408],[0.488,1.808],[1.863,2.248],[2.308,2.488],[2.541,2.968],[3.068,3.928],[4.068,4.568],[4.584,4.648],[4.701,4.808],[4.852,5.368],[5.388,5.448],[5.488,5.608],[5.668,6.088],[6.168,6.488],[6.536,6.728],[6.781,6.888],[6.941,7.048],[7.128,7.368]]},{"key":"fit#0","text":"Does the product really solve the problem?","words":[[8.616,8.648],[8.668,8.728],[8.798,9.288],[9.357,9.768],[9.821,10.088],[10.108,10.168],[10.228,10.728]]},{"key":"fit#1","text":"Eat Better - The Better Laddoos","words":[[11.228,11.528],[11.585,11.927],[11.928,11.929],[12.029,12.329],[12.363,12.569],[12.609,13.209]]},{"key":"fit#2","text":"Problem–Solution Fit exists when a defined group of target customers faces a recurring challenge, and a product addresses it effectively enough to drive continuous repeat purchases .","words":[[13.639,14.889],[14.969,15.209],[15.289,15.769],[15.817,16.009],[16.049,16.089],[16.149,16.569],[16.622,16.889],[16.916,16.969],[17.026,17.369],[17.433,18.009],[18.102,18.569],[18.609,18.649],[18.697,19.129],[19.185,20.009],[20.049,20.169],[20.209,20.249],[20.299,20.649],[20.705,21.209],[21.262,21.369],[21.422,22.009],[22.066,22.409],[22.516,22.729],[22.782,23.049],[23.114,23.769],[23.849,24.329],[24.393,24.969],[25.009,25.049]]},{"key":"fit#3","text":"A defined group of target customers","words":[[25.649,26.009],[26.059,26.409],[26.462,26.729],[26.756,26.809],[26.866,27.209],[27.265,27.769]]},{"key":"fit#4","text":"faces a recurring challenge","words":[[27.876,28.409],[28.489,28.569],[28.625,29.129],[29.193,29.769]]},{"key":"fit#5","text":"and a product addresses it effectively","words":[[30.089,30.329],[30.409,30.489],[30.549,30.969],[31.033,31.609],[31.662,31.769],[31.829,32.489]]},{"key":"fit#6","text":"enough to drive continuous repeat purchases","words":[[32.775,33.049],[33.076,33.129],[33.196,33.529],[33.594,34.249],[34.329,34.809],[34.881,35.529]]},{"key":"fit#explain","text":"Here's the idea: This chapter asks a big question: does the product really solve a real problem?","words":[[36.297,36.409],[36.449,36.569],[36.665,37.689],[37.737,37.929],[37.999,38.489],[38.585,38.969],[39.089,39.209],[39.269,39.449],[39.502,40.409],[40.505,40.889],[40.929,41.049],[41.119,41.609],[41.666,42.009],[42.062,42.329],[42.369,42.409],[42.457,42.649],[42.699,43.129]]},{"key":"market#0","text":"The problem — and the answer","words":[[43.914,43.929],[44.039,44.809],[44.869,44.929],[44.959,45.049],[45.069,45.129],[45.198,45.609]]},{"key":"market#1","text":"Try it · Re-engineer a snack","words":[[46.129,46.489],[46.702,47.129],[47.169,47.209],[47.289,48.089],[48.129,48.169],[48.262,48.729]]},{"key":"market#2","text":"Flip each switch to swap the old way for Eat Better's way. The flavour stays — the method changes.","words":[[49.193,49.769],[49.833,50.089],[50.18,50.729],[50.756,50.809],[50.889,51.209],[51.249,51.369],[51.429,51.609],[51.729,52.089],[52.129,52.249],[52.289,52.409],[52.466,52.889],[52.969,53.849],[53.889,54.009],[54.059,54.409],[54.502,54.969],[55.089,55.209],[55.229,55.289],[55.369,55.849],[55.939,56.729]]},{"key":"market#explain","text":"In simple words: The problem is that many snacks force people to choose between taste and health. Eat Better's answer is snacks that people love, made with better ingredients.","words":[[57.558,57.611],[57.668,58.011],[58.078,58.491],[58.611,58.971],[59.031,59.451],[59.531,59.691],[59.723,59.851],[59.899,60.091],[60.16,60.571],[60.638,60.971],[61.028,61.371],[61.398,61.451],[61.52,61.931],[61.981,62.331],[62.411,62.811],[62.891,63.131],[63.188,63.611],[63.871,64.651],[64.697,65.051],[65.097,65.371],[65.504,65.771],[65.84,66.251],[66.267,66.331],[66.377,66.651],[66.747,67.211],[67.291,67.611],[67.643,67.771],[67.828,68.171],[68.231,68.892]]},{"key":"expedition#0","text":"3 Activity · The Consumer Insight Expedition","words":[[70.011,70.251],[70.349,71.131],[71.451,71.771],[71.851,72.091],[72.127,72.411],[72.481,72.971],[73.036,73.691]]},{"key":"expedition#1","text":"Find the problem with evidence","words":[[74.864,75.056],[75.096,75.216],[75.276,75.696],[75.76,76.016],[76.078,76.576]]},{"key":"expedition#2","text":"You are a Junior Consumer Researcher. Walk the neighbourhood, interview fictional consumers, inspect what they snack on — and work out what really drives their choices, not just what they say they want.","words":[[77.276,77.696],[77.756,77.936],[77.976,78.016],[78.073,78.416],[78.478,78.976],[79.029,80.096],[80.192,80.576],[80.596,80.656],[80.69,81.216],[81.296,82.016],[82.064,82.496],[82.56,83.376],[83.456,84.016],[84.048,84.176],[84.208,84.336],[84.416,84.816],[84.896,85.056],[85.216,85.376],[85.416,85.536],[85.6,85.856],[85.916,86.096],[86.144,86.336],[86.393,86.736],[86.793,87.136],[87.163,87.296],[87.366,88.176],[88.236,88.416],[88.464,88.656],[88.704,88.896],[88.928,89.056],[89.136,89.376],[89.424,89.616],[89.68,90.016]]},{"key":"expedition#3","text":"The Consumer Insight Expedition","words":[[90.724,90.736],[90.789,91.216],[91.296,91.856],[91.914,92.496]]},{"key":"expedition#4","text":"Eat Better wants evidence, not guesses. Visit the supermarket, a family kitchen, an office break area and a college canteen. Interview fictional consumers, inspect what they snack on, and find the problem that keeps driving their choices.","words":[[92.946,93.216],[93.262,93.536],[93.589,93.856],[93.918,94.496],[94.576,94.816],[94.886,95.776],[95.896,96.496],[96.516,96.576],[96.636,97.456],[97.496,97.536],[97.593,97.936],[97.986,98.576],[98.629,98.736],[98.793,99.136],[99.189,99.456],[99.536,99.856],[99.956,100.256],[100.296,100.336],[100.386,100.736],[100.776,101.936],[101.992,102.496],[102.544,102.976],[103.048,103.936],[104.006,104.496],[104.528,104.656],[104.704,104.896],[104.963,105.296],[105.376,105.776],[105.816,105.936],[106.016,106.336],[106.356,106.416],[106.476,106.896],[106.928,107.056],[107.123,107.456],[107.516,107.936],[107.963,108.096],[108.176,108.896]]},{"key":"expedition#5","text":"Tap or click the ground to walk (WASD works too).","words":[[109.256,109.856],[109.909,110.016],[110.083,110.416],[110.436,110.496],[110.565,110.976],[111.029,111.136],[111.216,111.536],[111.856,113.056],[113.123,113.456],[113.536,114.176]]},{"key":"expedition#6","text":"Tap a person to talk. Ask what frustrates them — then ask why.","words":[[114.396,114.816],[114.856,114.896],[114.965,115.376],[115.429,115.536],[115.632,116.536],[116.666,117.056],[117.104,117.296],[117.365,118.016],[118.064,118.256],[118.416,118.576],[118.64,118.896],[118.976,119.216],[119.336,119.896]]},{"key":"expedition#7","text":"Tap the glowing ring by each person to inspect their snack.","words":[[120.276,120.816],[120.836,120.896],[120.956,121.376],[121.44,121.696],[121.749,121.856],[121.92,122.176],[122.245,122.656],[122.763,122.976],[123.046,123.536],[123.576,123.776],[123.856,124.523]]},{"key":"expedition#explain","text":"Think of it like this: In the expedition, you become a consumer researcher. You listen to what people say, and also watch what they actually do, to find the real problem.","words":[[125.16,125.227],[125.28,125.387],[125.414,125.467],[125.531,125.787],[125.851,126.187],[126.374,126.747],[126.787,126.907],[126.965,127.867],[127.907,128.027],[128.084,128.427],[128.507,128.587],[128.658,129.227],[129.292,130.427],[130.547,130.907],[130.953,131.227],[131.28,131.387],[131.419,131.547],[131.593,131.867],[131.967,132.507],[132.547,132.667],[132.747,133.067],[133.134,133.467],[133.515,133.707],[133.739,133.867],[133.938,134.507],[134.64,135.147],[135.2,135.307],[135.387,135.707],[135.727,135.787],[135.851,136.107],[136.167,136.667]]},{"key":"table#0","text":"The fit, at a glance","words":[[137.677,137.707],[137.807,138.187],[138.267,138.427],[138.467,138.507],[138.576,138.987]]},{"key":"table#1","text":"Tap each problem to turn it over.","words":[[139.787,140.267],[140.331,140.587],[140.667,141.227],[141.254,141.307],[141.355,141.547],[141.6,141.707],[141.771,142.307]]},{"key":"table#2","text":"“(brand claim)” means the fact comes from Eat Better itself. “Reported” means it was stated in public reports.","words":[[142.607,142.987],[143.067,143.707],[143.76,144.027],[144.067,144.187],[144.267,144.587],[144.654,144.987],[145.019,145.147],[145.227,145.467],[145.513,145.787],[145.878,146.867],[147.087,148.187],[148.24,148.507],[148.56,148.667],[148.707,148.827],[148.896,149.307],[149.334,149.387],[149.444,149.787],[149.867,150.747]]},{"key":"table#explain","text":"So what does that mean? The table puts it all together: each problem, Eat Better's answer, and the proof.","words":[[151.174,151.227],[151.259,151.387],[151.419,151.547],[151.579,151.707],[151.771,152.107],[152.347,153.067],[153.12,153.387],[153.451,153.707],[153.734,153.787],[153.827,153.947],[154,154.907],[154.955,155.147],[155.217,156.027],[156.087,156.267],[156.301,156.587],[156.644,157.067],[157.207,157.627],[157.667,157.787],[157.867,158.454]]},{"key":"signals#0","text":"Which signals really prove fit?","words":[[159.187,159.387],[159.457,159.947],[160.016,160.427],[160.48,160.747],[160.847,161.227]]},{"key":"signals#1","text":"A product can be famous without solving anyone's problem. Sort each signal: does it prove customers keep coming back?","words":[[162.097,162.107],[162.167,162.587],[162.627,162.747],[162.8,162.907],[162.976,163.387],[163.437,163.787],[163.847,164.267],[164.324,164.947],[164.982,165.747],[165.851,166.267],[166.347,166.667],[166.724,167.707],[167.739,167.867],[167.894,167.947],[168,168.267],[168.323,168.827],[168.891,169.147],[169.181,169.387],[169.467,170.08]]},{"key":"signals#explain","text":"Let me explain: So how do we know the fit is real? Fit is proven by repeat customers, not by advertising. Reviews, repeat orders and family-size packs are the real signals.","words":[[170.787,170.907],[170.934,170.987],[171.067,172.187],[172.24,172.347],[172.407,172.587],[172.614,172.667],[172.72,172.827],[172.875,173.067],[173.107,173.227],[173.327,173.627],[173.707,173.867],[173.947,174.787],[174.917,175.307],[175.387,175.547],[175.604,175.947],[176.027,176.187],[176.256,176.667],[176.723,177.467],[177.507,177.627],[177.68,177.787],[177.847,178.987],[179.107,180.187],[180.256,180.667],[180.724,181.067],[181.167,181.467],[181.524,182.267],[182.347,182.747],[182.807,182.987],[183.027,183.147],[183.211,183.467],[183.537,184.427]]},{"key":"think#0","text":"Find the problem yourself","words":[[185.179,185.227],[185.247,185.307],[185.377,185.867],[185.929,186.427]]},{"key":"think#1","text":"Interview five people at home or school about their snack choices. What problem do they mention most?","words":[[187.919,188.027],[188.107,188.427],[188.484,188.827],[188.88,188.987],[189.067,189.387],[189.467,189.627],[189.684,190.027],[190.094,190.427],[190.454,190.587],[190.64,190.907],[190.977,191.907],[191.995,192.347],[192.417,192.907],[192.934,192.987],[193.019,193.147],[193.187,193.467],[193.547,194.027]]},{"key":"outro","text":"And that's the whole chapter! You listened all the way through. Great job!","words":[[194.852,194.912],[194.96,195.232],[195.252,195.312],[195.352,195.552],[195.622,196.472],[196.562,196.832],[196.876,197.232],[197.292,197.472],[197.512,197.632],[197.672,197.792],[197.842,198.272],[198.379,198.912],[199.012,199.472]]}]}]}